# XXDP MAINDEC catalog for sim/run_xxdp.sh
# Fields, '|'-separated:
#   name | files in XXDP_ROOT | init_pc oct | cons_sw oct | pass_match | fail_match | fail_match2 | stop-time | budget
#
# "files" is one basename or comma-separated basenames, loaded in order
# (later overlays earlier) by abs2mem.py onto one 64K image.
#
# cons_sw 104001 = SW15 halt-on-error + SW11 inhibit-iterations + SW00 skip operator (EKBAD0).
# ZMMCA0 uses 0 so the diagnostic takes default limits 2710-17470.
# stop-time must be > budget*20ns to let the scoreboard TIMEOUT fire;
# budget is cpu clocks (20 ns). 20ms was only enough for the EKBAD0 banner.
#
EKBAD0|EKBAD0.BIC|200|104001|END PASS|TEST NUMBER||500ms|30000000
ZMMCA0|ZMMCA0.BIC|200|0||WRITE-READ ERROR|DUAL ADDRESS ERROR|2sec|120000000
